1 part1_006 : KeyCodeInput 4 T E,S W,G Q
1 part1_007 : KeyCodeInput 4 W,Q H,D Q,W E,E
2 part1_008 : Tremolo 4 T - - -; KeyCodeInput 4 - - A S,D
1 part1_009 : KeyCodeInput 4 G - W Q,H

